Package: ccwbalance
Type: Package
Title: Artificial-Censoring Diagnostics for Clone-Censor-Weight Analyses
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yuta", "Nonomiya", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ynonomiya.ocum@gmail.com")
Description: Diagnostics for the artificial-censoring weights of
    clone-censor-weight analyses in target trial emulation. Provides
    interval and cumulative risk-set reconstruction balance, with
    Kolmogorov-Smirnov and Mahalanobis versions; censoring balance; a
    conditional parametric null reference for the maximum absolute
    imbalance; an individual-level bootstrap; end-of-grace and
    between-strategy standardised mean differences; weight-support
    summaries; plots; construction of the long data from observational
    records; and a simulation data-generating mechanism.
URL: https://github.com/Nonokyu/ccwbalance
BugReports: https://github.com/Nonokyu/ccwbalance/issues
